      "title": "Parametrizing an Elliptic Cylinder"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "11fe97f3-63bd-5411-ab29-f95eb28e1b29",
      ":question/problem": "$$\n\\mathbf{f}(t,z)=⟨\\text{_____},\\,8 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)},\\,z⟩\n$$\n\nThe vector-valued function $\\mathbf{f}(t,z)$ above parametrizes the elliptic cylinder defined in Cartesian coordinates as $16x^{2}+9y^{2}=576.$ What is the first component of $\\mathbf{f}?$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Recall that the ellipse $16x^{2}+9y^{2}=576$, or equivalently $\\frac{x^{2}}{36}+\\frac{y^{2}}{64}=1$, in the $xy$-plane has the parametrization\n\n$$\n⟨x,y⟩=⟨6 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)},\\,8 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)}⟩,\\quad t\\in[0,2\\pi),\n$$\n\nsince\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x^2}{36}+\\frac{y^2}{64}&=\\frac{(6 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)})^2}{36}+\\frac{(8 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)})^2}{64}\\\\&=\\cos^2 t+\\sin^2 t\\\\&=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, for any point $(x,y,z)$ on our surface, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{f}(t,z)=⟨x,y,z⟩=⟨6 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)},\\,8 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)},\\,z⟩\n$$\n\nwhere $t\\in[0,2\\pi)$ and $z\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)$.\n\nTherefore, the first component of $\\mathbf{f}$ is $6 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}$.",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "7b971b44-dd6d-539f-ad43-2f79ff24f3d9",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "e8a26b0b-6913-5c05-be5e-b9e8955b5a36",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "8 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "86f3df1f-3d24-58ed-9d56-a1a62e9c0254",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "6 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "244a6b6a-a274-516b-af07-ff80eac08b6f",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "6 z"
            },
